Looking at the problem, I need to show that any set of $2\times 2$ integer matrices with square entries $\leq 200$ having more than $50387$ elements must contain two commuting matrices.

**Answer Leak Check:** The problem statement contains no leaked answers or solution sketches. Proceeding to solve.

